  "label": "Generational memory and aging stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the concept of generational memory — the idea that older people recall and reflect on cultural expressions and social norms from their youth. This requires understanding of how language and social behavior evolve over time, and how aging is culturally framed as a period of reflection on past norms. The phrase 'I'm so old' is a common self-deprecating expression tied to aging.",
